<code>assert CollectionUtils.isEqualCollection(this, coll);</code>
--------------------
<code>assert CollectionUtils.isEqualCollection(this, coll);</code>

However, since we need to use only publicly accessible observer methods and avoid calling the method being tested, we should use the `size()` and `contains()` methods to verify the equality. Here's the corrected assert statement:

<code>assert coll.size() == this.size() && \forall Object o; coll.contains(o) <=> this.contains(o);</code>
--------------------
<code>assert CollectionUtils.isEqualCollection(coll, this);</code>
--------------------
